/T (Abstract Wordwise is a web-based English learning platform that helps non-native speakers improve vocabulary, pronunciation, and reading skills. The system uses real-time speech recognition to verify pronunciation and provide instant feedback. It introduces new words daily using a Divide-and-Conquer method that breaks complex words into roots, prefixes, and suffixes. Users also read current news articles filtered by difficulty level, take weekly adaptive tests to measure progress, and receive a Word of the Day with spaced repetition scheduling.)
/E (Abstract Wordwise is a web-based English learning platform that helps non-native speakers improve vocabulary, pronunciation, and reading skills. The system uses real-time speech recognition to verify pronunciation and provide instant feedback. It introduces new words daily using a Divide-and-Conquer method that breaks complex words into roots, prefixes, and suffixes. Users also read current news articles filtered by difficulty level, take weekly adaptive tests to measure progress, and receive a Word of the Day with spaced repetition scheduling.)
