/T (Introduction English is essential for academic and professional growth, yet many learners struggle with pronunciation, vocabulary, and reading fluency. Traditional classroom methods provide limited speaking practice and no personalised feedback. Existing apps focus narrowly on word lists without addressing pronunciation or word structure. Wordwise addresses these gaps through five integrated modules: \(1\) Pronunciation Coach with real-time feedback, \(2\) Vocabulary Builder with daily word cards, \(3\) News-Based Reading with CEFR-levelled articles, \(4\) Word Decomposition using the Divide-and-Conquer approach, and \(5\) Weekly Adaptive Assessment for progress tracking.)
/E (Introduction English is essential for academic and professional growth, yet many learners struggle with pronunciation, vocabulary, and reading fluency. Traditional classroom methods provide limited speaking practice and no personalised feedback. Existing apps focus narrowly on word lists without addressing pronunciation or word structure. Wordwise addresses these gaps through five integrated modules: \(1\) Pronunciation Coach with real-time feedback, \(2\) Vocabulary Builder with daily word cards, \(3\) News-Based Reading with CEFR-levelled articles, \(4\) Word Decomposition using the Divide-and-Conquer approach, and \(5\) Weekly Adaptive Assessment for progress tracking.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
