/T (Conclusion Wordwise provides a complete, technology-driven solution for English language learners by combining pronunciation verification, vocabulary learning, news reading, spaced repetition, and adaptive assessment in one platform. The Divide-and-Conquer Word Decomposition method is a key feature that teaches learners how to decode unfamiliar words independently rather than memorising them individually. The project uses a well-defined technology stack, measurable evaluation criteria, and a pilot study plan, making it technically feasible and academically structured. Wordwise has the potential to serve as a scalable resource that meaningfully improves English proficiency for learners.)
/E (Conclusion Wordwise provides a complete, technology-driven solution for English language learners by combining pronunciation verification, vocabulary learning, news reading, spaced repetition, and adaptive assessment in one platform. The Divide-and-Conquer Word Decomposition method is a key feature that teaches learners how to decode unfamiliar words independently rather than memorising them individually. The project uses a well-defined technology stack, measurable evaluation criteria, and a pilot study plan, making it technically feasible and academically structured. Wordwise has the potential to serve as a scalable resource that meaningfully improves English proficiency for learners.)
